      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفاقحوا</span></b>  <i>They put</i> [or <i>turned</i>] <i>their backs
one towards another;</i> (S, K;) [from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَقْحَةٌ</span>, q. v.;]
like as you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَظَاهَرُوا</span> [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَدَابَرُوا</span>] and [in the
contr. sense] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَابَلُوا</span>. (S, TA.)

